// contains would also match "notmimikatzhere" but cannot use the
// index, so it scans every row. Only reach for it when you genuinely
// need a substring match inside a larger token.`),Ye("iff-and-coalesce","Fill in a missing column","Easy","operators",["SigninLogs"],"Some sign-in rows have no UserPrincipalName but do have an AlternateSignInName. Produce one clean account column that prefers the UPN and falls back, and drop rows where neither exists.","coalesce() takes the first non-empty. isnotempty() to filter afterwards.",`SigninLogs
